<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine Central Bank reserves detailed.</title>
<headline>Argentine Central Bank reserves detailed.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Argentine Central Bank Friday released the following international reserve and currency liability data, in millions:</p>
<p>*A = International reserves (gold, currency, securities, including repos and reverse repos).</p>
<p>B = Liquidity requirements.</p>
<p>C = International reserves in the financial system.</p>
<p>*D = Monetary base.</p>
<p>E = Currency liabilities.</p>
<p>F = Net repurchase tender agreements.</p>
<p>G = Bank liquidity paper.</p>
<p>H = Financial liabilities.</p>
<p>   Date	*A*   *B*    *C*    *D*    *E*   *F*  *G*   *H*</p>
<p>Jul 11  22,381 5,895 28,276 15,113 15,157 5,619  0  20,776</p>
<p>Jul 14  22,219 5,855 28,074 15,024 15,068 5,571  0  20,639</p>
<p>Jul 15  22.086 5,851 27,937 14,869 14,911 5,584  0  20.495</p>
<p>Jul 16  22,039 5,822 27,861 14,758 14,802 5,666  0  20,468</p>
<p>Jul 17  22,027 5,960 27,987 14,755 14,801 5,649  0  20,450</p>
<p>Jul 18  22,007 6,119 28,126 14,790 14,836 5,568  0  20,404</p>
<p>Jul 21  22,035 6,074 28,109 14,769 14,815 5,069  0  20,421</p>
<p>Jul 22  22,067 6,150 28,217 14,645 14,693 5,758  0  20,451</p>
<p>Jul 23  22,212 6,380 28,592 14,546 14,554 6,003  0  20,557</p>
<p>*A  Of the $22.21 billion in international reserves, $1.91 billion (8.59 percent) are in securities.</p>
<p>*D  There are currently no peso-denominated current accounts at the Central Bank.</p>
<p>((-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +54 1 318-0651))</p>
</text>
